And there is a second, and very likely, source of
the behavior described. If one food item ages to
rotten status between picking up a different rotten
food item, dropping it, and picking it up again,
then the two items will fail to merge the first
time, and merge the second time. Moreover, that
would not be a bug, but intended, behavior, just
not behavior expected by the player.

